WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.660
[Background noise]

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:05.700
Hi. It's me.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.680
You may be wondering to yourself

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.420
"Where am I?", or "Where am me?"

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.780
Not you-- me! Where is Markiplier right now?

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:16.620
And you may be also wondering why am I leaning on the bed at such a weird angle.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:18.080
None of that is important right now

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.080
I've got some information to tell you.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.080
And I only know one way to do it properly...

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.380
...

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:24.580
...with Stock footage.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.580
[Soothing Music]  My day started like any other

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.580
I woke up early,

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:30.300
Before the crack of dawn.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.600
Got out of bed.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:32.780
Showered,

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.360
Brushed my teeth,

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:37.800
And then-- I realized that today was the day

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:41.180
On my calendar it said the day that it was was today

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:42.840
And no other day...

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.560
So I packed my bags,

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:47.040
And then flew out the door free as a bird,

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:49.040
Fresh as a flowing river,

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:50.780
--WIDE!!!

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:51.980
[Silence]

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:54.020
[uncertain of what to say next]

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:56.420
And then I hopped on a plane...

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:58.260
Cramped... in the backseats.

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:03.300
I flew, to my destination of the place where I am where you're wondering where I am right now.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:05.240
And that place ...

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:07.460
Is something so horrible that I can't actually tell you.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.980
But the smarter among you may already know where I am.

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:12.240
Here's a hint:

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:14.160
It rhymes with...

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:19.640
Schmenny schmarbae-bapto...

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:20.800
[he is being serious guys, it rhymes]

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:24.400
And while I'm here, I'm going to be making numerous videos...

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:26.740
Here... where I am.

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:28.480
And you'll see them with your eyes

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:29.880
Or on your television

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:31.620
Or on your mobile device.

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:34.520
But I'm also going to be going on another adventure while I'm here,

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:36.940
To untold lands, far and away.

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:39.220
And there

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:41.480
Who knows what kind of fate I'll meet

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:44.060
What dragons I will slay.

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:46.000
[High-pitched guitar note]

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:48.260
[Three low register guitar notes end the song]

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:50.600
[Shady cult ritual humming noise in the background]

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:52.280
Yeah, I'm in Boston [claps]

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:53.540
Uuuummm...

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:54.800
Sooo...

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.240
Here for PAX!

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:58.800
Hehhh!

